<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">◉</span>
    <div>
      <h1>Token Launch Radar</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Protocols that record no token yet, ranked by what their launch would be worth — and how to farm each one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="stamp" id="stamp">Loading snapshot…</div>
</header>
<main id="app" aria-busy="true"></main>
<footer class="foot">
  <p>Implied value is this radar's own model output: TVL × the median market-cap/TVL multiple of live tokens in the same category, adjusted for seven-day momentum and for time tracked with no token recorded. It is not a prediction that any protocol will issue a token. A protocol listed here records no token in the snapshot; that is a statement about the record, not proof none exists.</p>
</footer>
<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
